1
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:22,600
Zhijiang Infinite Capacity Technology (Zhejiang) Co., Ltd. Zhejiang Yanhe Culture Technology Co., Ltd.

2
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,680
Your Highness should check

3
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:05,680
Chu Xiaoxiao's files.

4
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:07,540
I believe you'll find something.

5
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,840
Princess,

6
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:11,740
