7
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,640
I thought...

8
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:15,539
What did you think?

9
00:01:16,039 --> 00:01:18,480
That I was a woman who only cared about the manor

10
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:20,539
and ignored the affairs of the world?

11
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:23,250
It is so hard to be the Princess of Ling.

12
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:25,680
Being too smart invites suspicion.

13
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:28,400
Talking too much brings trouble.

14
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,400
Actually,

15
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,400
I also know how to investigate cases.

16
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,640
Why don't we investigate

17
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,039
together from tomorrow?

18
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,920
That way, we can also...

19
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:37,780
I'm a bit tired.

20
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,100
I want to get some rest.

21
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:43,620
Will Your Highness

22
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,920
still sleep in the study tonight?

23
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:46,280
Yes.

24
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:49,280
I still have some things to figure out.

25
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,880
It seems that

26
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:53,320
Your Highness prefers the role of Shen Zhao.

27
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:54,320
But don't forget,

28
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:56,920
you are the master of this manor after all.

29
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,380
Leave the investigations

30
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,140
to the government office.

31
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Rest early.

32
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,079
Come in.

33
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,320
What's the situation?

34
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:23,450
Why are you rich kids up so early today?

35
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,360
I found out.

36
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,420
Found out what?

37
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,420
The real killer

38
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,360
is A Xiao.

39
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,120
Her real name is Chu Xiaoxiao.

40
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,520
She is Chu Feng's sister.

41
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,400
How did you find out?

42
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,520
Who do you think I am?

43
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:35,200
I found it through this fabric.

44
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:36,040
A Xiao.

45
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,850
Isn't she Musician Han's maid?

46
00:02:39,079 --> 00:02:39,680
She's not.

47
00:02:40,079 --> 00:02:41,400
She's a musician from Chang'an.

48
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,360
A musician?

49
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:43,240
Lord Su!

50
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,079
Lord Su!

51
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:45,610
Bad news!

52
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,800
Li Qingluan is going to Zuixian Restaurant

53
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,000
to have a musical duel with Ashina Xiao.

54
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,000
He even put up a notice

55
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,400
saying he'll avenge his master and Senior Brother Cui.

56
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:51,840
Oh no.

57
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,490
Let's go.

58
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,079
Hurry.

59
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,700
Will someone die again this time?

60
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,800
I see Li Qingluan is very confident.

61
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:04,840
He will definitely beat Ashina Xiao.

62
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,100
Western Regions brat!

63
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:06,840
Today,

64
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,140
I will make you die.

65
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:12,090
Brother Chu Feng, after today's tune,

66
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,970
your revenge will be complete.

67
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,000
You can rest in peace.

68
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,560
Cut the crap.

69
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:18,960
Today,

70
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:21,040
with the real 'Nanshan Youtai' in hand,

71
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,570
I will definitely beat you.

72
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,120
Second Senior Brother.

73
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,840
This is the real 'Nanshan Youtai' music score

74
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,840
left by the master.

75
00:03:31,079 --> 00:03:33,079
I don't know where First Senior Brother got his,

76
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:34,240
but it must be fake.

77
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,360
First Senior Brother is always arrogant,

78
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:40,160
and Third Senior Brother is weak and incompetent.

79
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,400
In my heart,

80
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,400
only the righteous Second Senior Brother

81
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:46,530
is qualified to inherit the master's 'Nanshan Youtai'.

82
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,460
Senior Brother Qingluan.

83
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:54,000
This is the 'Nanshan Youtai'

84
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,960
the master kept secret his whole life.

85
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:58,280
It was originally meant for Senior Brother Chu Feng.

86
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:00,120
But Senior Brother Chu Feng is gone,

87
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,720
and the master favors Senior Brother Cui.

88
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,450
He never cared about you at all.

89
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:04,960
With this score,

90
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,880
you can definitely beat Ashina Xiao.

91
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:08,280
Let everyone know

92
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:11,320
that you are the best musician in Fangzhou.

93
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,320
Right.

94
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,080
Master was blind.

95
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:16,680
Even a good-for-nothing like Cui Yujing could be First Senior Brother.

96
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:17,740
He deserved to die.

97
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,130
Actually, I am Master's best student.

98
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,480
Yes.

99
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,800
I've always thought so.

100
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,440
In my heart,

101
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,680
you are the best.

102
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:28,800
A Xiao.

103
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:32,290
As long as you beat Ashina Xiao,

104
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:34,120
I will

105
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,240
be with you.

106
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,840
Then we will leave Fangzhou together,

107
00:04:39,159 --> 00:04:40,800
open your own music academy,

108
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:43,570
and never have to look at others' faces again.

109
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,000
A Xiao.

110
00:04:45,159 --> 00:04:46,690
You understand me the best.

111
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,360
Make way.

112
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:31,210
We are still a step too late.

113
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,240
Stop.

114
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,730
Don't play anymore.

115
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,409
What's going on?

116
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:43,000
Because I put Gu poison in your well water.

117
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,010
How are you so powerful?

118
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,880
Who exactly are you?

119
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:35,240
Young Master Shen's melody disturbed Ashina Xiao.

120
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,480
He has gone mad.

121
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,680
Ashina Xiao.

122
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,500
You conspired with A'xiao

123
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,800
to kill people with Gu poison and fake music scores.

124
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,000
Confess your crimes!

125
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,120
Why are you framing me?

126
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,240
Chu Xiaoxiao.

127
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,800
Stop pretending.

128
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,120
Your brother is Chu Feng.

129
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,140
You are a musician from Chang'an.

130
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:14,300
This piece of cloth is from your clothes.

131
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,360
This time,

132
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,680
you are here to avenge your brother.

133
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,600
A'xiao.

134
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,160
Lord Su.

135
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,400
You are truly a great detective.

136
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,680
It really is you.

137
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,000
Catch the zither!

138
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,360
Today,

139
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,080
I will avenge my brother.

140
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:39,120
All of you onlookers are guilty.

141
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:43,140
Once I play the final chapter of the 'Insect Gu Ballad',

142
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,330
you will all be buried with my brother.

143
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,720
A'xiao, stop!

144
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:52,440
Brother Chu Feng wouldn't want you

145
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,400
to kill innocent people.

146
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,600
Don't shoot!

147
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,320
Let's go!

148
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:07,900
Chase them!

149
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,200
Come on!

150
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:22,480
Brother,

151
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,260
you have been avenged.

152
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,520
You can rest in peace now.

153
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,240
That skull belongs to Chu Feng.

154
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:41,840
Chu Xiaoxiao.

155
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,720
You killed innocent people for revenge.

156
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,600
Aren't you afraid of divine punishment?

157
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:48,080
Kill innocent people?

158
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,240
Who is exactly killing innocent people?
